---
# clang-tidy configuration, used by `make clang-tidy` and `clang-tidy.bat`.
#
# The check set is listed explicitly because LLVM 23 enables only clang-diagnostic-* by default
# and then exits with "no checks enabled".
#
# clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling is disabled: in C11 mode it
# flags every memcpy/snprintf and recommends the Annex K *_s functions, which are optional and not
# provided by glibc, so the advice cannot be followed portably.
Checks: 'clang-diagnostic-*,clang-analyzer-*,-clang-analyzer-security.insecureAPI.DeprecatedOrUnsafeBufferHandling'
